{"comments":"Hue Scrubable Input — Color wheel position control (0-359°)\n\nA motion graphics numeric input specialized for hue values.\nWraps around at 360° (359° + 1° = 0°).\n\n## Usage\n\n```purescript\nimport Hydrogen.Element.Compound.Motion.Property.Scrub.Hue as HueScrub\nimport Hydrogen.Schema.Color.Hue (Hue)\n\nmyHueInput :: Hue -> Element Msg\nmyHueInput h = HueScrub.hueScrub h\n  [ HueScrub.label \"Hue\"\n  , HueScrub.onChange SetHue\n  ]\n```\n\n## Bounds\n\n| Property  | Value | Notes |\n|-----------|-------|-------|\n| Min       | 0°    | Red   |\n| Max       | 359°  | Almost red (wraps to 0) |\n| Step      | 1°    | Integer degrees |\n| Precision | 0     | No decimal places |\n| Unit      | \"°\"   | Degree symbol |\n| Wrapping  | Yes   | 360° becomes 0° |\n","declarations":[{"children":[],"comments":"Hue scrubable input\n\nA motion graphics numeric input specialized for hue values.\nUses the Hue Schema atom for type-safe color wheel position.\n\n```purescript\nhueScrub (Hue.hue 180)\n  [ label \"Fill Hue\"\n  , onChange SetFillHue\n  ]\n```\n","info":{"declType":"value","type":{"annotation":[],"contents":{"identifier":"msg","kind":null,"skolem":null,"type":{"annotation":[],"contents":[{"annotation":[],"contents":[{"annotation":[],"contents":[["Prim"],"Function"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"},{"annotation":[],"contents":[["Hydrogen","Schema","Color","Hue"],"Hue"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"}],"tag":"TypeApp"},{"annotation":[],"contents":[{"annotation":[],"contents":[{"annotation":[],"contents":[["Prim"],"Function"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"},{"annotation":[],"contents":[{"annotation":[],"contents":[["Prim"],"Array"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"},{"annotation":[],"contents":{"annotation":[],"contents":[{"annotation":[],"contents":[["Hydrogen","Element","Compound","Motion","Property","Scrub","Hue"],"HueScrubProp"],"tag":"TypeConstructor"},{"annotation":[],"contents":"msg","tag":"TypeVar"}],"tag":"TypeApp"},"tag":"ParensInType"}],"tag":"TypeApp"}],"tag":"TypeApp"},{"annot